  "overview": "Tailwind Elements — Tailwind-based component kit, Roboto typography and Material-inspired indigo accents",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fcfcfd) canvas paired with `#4f4f4f` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#d9e4f3` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Roboto` across 1 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
